.review-phase-boundaries` requires `.rebar/prompts/code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries.md`, but the runtime reports that prompt id as unknown. This was observed from current `origin/main` while preparing Gerrit change 990.\n\n## Approach\nTrace project prompt discovery/registration for code-review criteria and align the project criterion reference with the prompt id loaded by the runtime. Rejected: bypassing the project criterion, because that would silently reduce review coverage.\n\n## Scope\n- `.rebar/prompts/code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries.md` and the code-review prompt discovery/registry path identified during diagnosis.\n\n## Testing\n- Reproduce the current failure with the documented `rebar review-code --base origin/main --head HEAD -o text` preview.\n- Verify the same command reaches review with project criteria enabled after the fix.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The project phase-boundary prompt is discoverable by local `rebar review-code`; verified by the preview command reaching the reviewer without an unknown-prompt error.\n- [ ] Existing built-in and project prompt discovery tests pass.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["code-review","prompt-registry"],"ticket_id":"2ea4-dcf2-8d78-4ef4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Local code review rejects project phase-boundary prompt","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6e326774-35ec-4894-a57b-b519e4617750","dc356744-fc59-4e1e-b175-51e08b5c117b"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785200269197255002,"uuid":"7c402873-5144-463e-ae4f-f8c67aa25d07"}